# settings-pointer (SM · States): the panel under the pointer: a theme's row hovered (--secondary),
# the toggle's Light hovered (--secondary) and held down (--primary at 26 %); released, Light
# applies: the page and the panel turn Clean Teal and the list's new content fades in over 160 ms
# (D7), shot at rest; the pointer back in the gap.
# Positions at 1440 x 900 from the reference's DOM with the panel open (tools/run dom): the gear
# (1363, 28, 40 x 40), the panel (1099, 76, 304 x 256); the Appearance toggle's options 91.33 x 34
# from (1113, 112) (System, Light, Dark: centres 1159, 1251, 1343 at y 129); the theme rows 278 x 36
# from (1112, 211), 36 apart (centres at y 229, 265, 301); the help line (1112, 155, 278 x 18); the
# gap between the two settings y 173 to 189. The panel's opening runs 643 ms, so a shot of it at
# rest waits 700.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode system
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
click 1383 48
wait 700
move 1251 265
wait 16
shot row-hover
move 1251 129
wait 16
shot option-hover
down
wait 16
shot option-pressed
up
wait 200
shot light
move 1250 181
wait 16
shot rest
